{% doc %}
  Renders the storefront header: logo or shop name, main menu up to three
  levels (mega panel from 80rem), mobile drawer, search link, customer
  account entry and cart link.
  Composed directly in layout/theme.liquid so it wraps every page. All
  disclosures are <details>, so the menu and the drawer work without
  JavaScript; JS only enhances them.

  Logo order (ADR 0011): the block logo, then the theme logo (Theme settings,
  Logo and favicon), then the shop name as text.

  Dark 80px bar on every page (TE-1 AC9, foundation §3): dark background with
  noise, light text and icons, white focus outline. It never overlays a hero
  or banner; there is no transparent mode and no data-header-overlay hook.
  The current page link (aria-current="page") is white with a 2px underline.

  Hooks:
  - data-sticky: on the root when the sticky_header setting is on. Only the
    header container sticks; the announcement bar above scrolls away.
  - data-scrolled: set on the root by JS once the header starts to stick; CSS
    adds the shadow only, background and height stay the same.
  - data-header-enhanced: still set by assets/header-sticky.js, no CSS reads it.
  - header-sticky-sentinel: 1px element in layout/theme.liquid right before
    the header container. It leaves the viewport when the header starts to
    stick (after the announcement bar when there is one).
  - Partial region: cart-count.
  - header-search-link: a real link to the search page, so search works without
    JavaScript. The next element sibling must stay the search dialog of
    snippets/predictive-search.liquid; JS opens it from this link.
  - data-cart-link, aria-haspopup="dialog": on the cart link when the cart drawer
    is active (cart_type is drawer and the template is not cart). JS opens the
    drawer from it; without JS it stays a plain link to routes.cart_url. Same
    condition as data-mode in blocks/cart-drawer.liquid.
  - Custom element host: <header-menu>, <header-drawer>, <sticky-header> (ẩn) — JS ở assets/header-menu.js, assets/header-sticky.js.

  Drawer dưới 80rem (TE-1 AC2, AC3, AC10; navigation.md §2, §5.2, §5.3, §6; localization.md §4.4;
  hợp đồng TE-1-R2-FE3 / TE-1-R2-BE1):
  - <details class="site-header__drawer"> chỉ là bản dự phòng: chưa có JS hoặc không JS thì bấm
    summary mở details, summary thành scrim (bấm là đóng), dialog hiện bằng CSS, cấp 2 là accordion
    <details> tại chỗ, phần đầu cấp 2 (Back, ×, tiêu đề) ẩn bằng `hidden`.
  - data-drawer-enhanced: BE gắn lên root header khi header-drawer.js nắm drawer. Từ đó CSS không
    dùng summary làm scrim nữa; BE mở bằng details.open = true + <modal-dialog data-layer="menu">.open(summary),
    đóng (modal:close) thì details.open = false và đóng mọi cấp 2 (lần mở sau về cấp 1).
    Cấp 2 (details[open] > [data-drawer-level]) phủ cả drawer, trượt vào, phần đầu cấp 2 hiện.
  - header-drawer-level (data-drawer-level="2", role="group" + aria-labelledby tiêu đề cấp 2):
    panel cấp 2 của mục menu có con và của hàng localization.
  - header-drawer-back: nút Back (tên "Back to menu") trong phần đầu cấp 2; BE: details.open = false,
    focus về summary vừa mở. × trong phần đầu cấp 2 là .close-button nên <modal-dialog> tự đóng.
  - header-drawer-localization: <details> hàng gộp "cờ + USD / EN ›" trong chân drawer, bọc trong
    {% form 'localization' %}; mỗi mục là nút submit nên đổi được khi không JS.
  - header-drawer-account: <shopify-account> trong chân drawer (Sign In).

  Mega menu từ 80rem (TE-22 AC1–AC3, navigation.md §2, §3; hợp đồng TE-22-R2-FE2 / TE-22-R2-BE1):
  - Kiểu panel theo dữ liệu menu, không setting: data-mega="columns" (A, có cấp 3)
    hoặc "tiles" (B, mọi con là collection) trên <details> cấp 1; còn lại là
    dropdown C (ul.site-header__submenu, không data-mega).
  - <summary> mục mega có data-layer="mega" (lớp không modal) + aria-expanded
    do JS đồng bộ; aria-controls trỏ id HeaderSubmenu-N của vùng nội dung panel.
  - header-mega-panel: panel trắng full bề ngang ngay dưới header, cao tối đa
    100dvh − header, cuộn riêng. Bên trong giữ data-testid="header-submenu" +
    class site-header__submenu cho spec cũ (TE-1, ES1-T16, ES1-T235).
  - header-mega-column: cột A. Cột 1 = "View all …" + con không cấp 3 + nhóm đầu.
  - header-scrim: lớp tối 50% từ đáy header, nằm trong <summary> nên khi không JS
    bấm vào là đóng. Khi có JS mặc định pointer-events: none (rê ra trang vẫn
    tính là rời header); JS gắn data-mega-enhanced lên root header khi tự xử lý
    bấm scrim và rời panel thì scrim nhận bấm.
  - data-mega-instant: JS gắn lên root header khi đổi panel từ mục cha này sang
    mục khác để bỏ hiệu ứng mở (navigation.md §6), gỡ sau khi đổi xong.

  Self-contained block: callers leave the body empty.

  @example
  {% block 'header' -%}{%- endblock %}
{% enddoc %}

{%- liquid
  assign menu = block.settings.menu
  assign logo = block.settings.logo | default: settings.logo
  assign has_menu = false
  if menu.links.size > 0
    assign has_menu = true
  endif

  assign cart_type = settings.cart_type | default: 'drawer'
  assign cart_drawer_active = true
  if cart_type == 'page' or template.name == 'cart'
    assign cart_drawer_active = false
  endif

  # Localization trong chân drawer: chỉ phần có > 1 mục (TE-1 AC5, localization.md §2)
  assign show_countries = false
  if localization.available_countries.size > 1
    assign show_countries = true
  endif
  assign show_languages = false
  if localization.available_languages.size > 1
    assign show_languages = true
  endif
-%}

<header
  class="site-header full-width"
  data-testid="header"
  {% if block.settings.sticky_header %}
    data-sticky
  {% endif %}
  {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
>
  <div class="site-header__inner">
    {% if has_menu %}
      <details class="site-header__drawer" scroll-lock>
        <summary
          class="site-header__icon"
          id="HeaderDrawerToggle"
          data-testid="header-drawer-toggle"
          aria-controls="HeaderDrawer"
        >
          <span class="visually-hidden">{{ 'blocks.header.open_menu' | t }}</span>
          {% render 'header-icon', name: 'menu' %}
        </summary>

        <modal-dialog data-layer="menu" data-return-focus="HeaderDrawerToggle">
          <dialog
            class="drawer site-header__drawer-panel"
            id="HeaderDrawer"
            aria-labelledby="HeaderDrawerTitle"
            data-testid="header-drawer"
          >
            <div class="drawer__header">
              <p class="drawer__title site-header__drawer-title" id="HeaderDrawerTitle">
                {{- 'blocks.header.menu_title' | t -}}
              </p>
              <button
                type="button"
                class="close-button"
                data-testid="header-drawer-close"
                aria-label="{{ 'blocks.header.close_menu' | t }}"
              >
                {% render 'header-icon', name: 'close' %}
              </button>
            </div>

            <nav class="drawer__body site-header__drawer-body" aria-label="{{ 'blocks.header.drawer_menu_label' | t }}">
              <ul class="site-header__drawer-menu">
                {% for link in menu.links %}
                  <li data-testid="header-menu-item">
                    {% if link.links.size > 0 %}
                      {%- liquid
                        case link.type
                          when 'catalog_link'
                            assign view_all = 'blocks.header.view_all_products' | t
                          when 'collections_link'
                            assign view_all = 'blocks.header.view_all_collections' | t
                          else
                            assign link_title = link.title | escape
                            assign view_all = 'blocks.header.view_all' | t: title: link_title
                        endcase
                        assign level_id = 'HeaderDrawerLevel-' | append: forloop.index
                        assign drawer_index = forloop.index
                      -%}
                      <details>
                        <summary
                          class="site-header__drawer-row"
                          data-testid="header-drawer-accordion-toggle"
                          aria-controls="HeaderDrawerSubmenu-{{ drawer_index }}"
                        >
                          {{ link.title | escape }}
                          {% render 'header-icon', name: 'chevron' %}
                        </summary>
                        <div
                          class="site-header__drawer-level"
                          role="group"
                          aria-labelledby="{{ level_id }}"
                          data-drawer-level="2"
                          data-testid="header-drawer-level"
                        >
                          {%- assign level_title = link.title | escape -%}
                          {%- render 'header-drawer-head', title: level_title, id: level_id -%}
                          <ul
                            class="site-header__drawer-submenu"
                            id="HeaderDrawerSubmenu-{{ drawer_index }}"
                            data-testid="header-drawer-submenu"
                          >
                            <li>
                              <a class="site-header__drawer-view-all" href="{{ link.url }}">
                                {{- view_all -}}
                                {%- render 'slideshow-icon', name: 'arrow' -%}
                              </a>
                            </li>
                            {% for child in link.links %}
                              <li>
                                {%- if child.links.size > 0 -%}
                                  {%- comment -%} Nhóm cấp 3 (TE-22 AC4): tiêu đề nhóm là link, không <h*> {%- endcomment -%}
                                  {%- assign group_id = 'HeaderDrawerGroup-' | append: drawer_index | append: '-' | append: forloop.index -%}
                                  <a
                                    class="site-header__drawer-group-title"
                                    id="{{ group_id }}"
                                    href="{{ child.url }}"
                                    {% if child.current %}
                                      aria-current="page"
                                    {% endif %}
                                  >
                                    {{- child.title | escape -}}
                                  </a>
                                  <ul aria-labelledby="{{ group_id }}">
                                    {%- for grandchild in child.links -%}
                                      <li>
                                        <a
                                          href="{{ grandchild.url }}"
                                          {% if grandchild.current %}
                                            aria-current="page"
                                          {% endif %}
                                        >
                                          {{- grandchild.title | escape -}}
                                        </a>
                                      </li>
                                    {%- endfor -%}
                                  </ul>
                                {%- else -%}
                                  <a
                                    href="{{ child.url }}"
                                    {% if child.current %}
                                      aria-current="page"
                                    {% endif %}
                                  >
                                    {{- child.title | escape -}}
                                  </a>
                                {%- endif -%}
                              </li>
                            {% endfor %}
                          </ul>
                        </div>
                      </details>
                    {% else %}
                      <a
                        class="site-header__drawer-row"
                        href="{{ link.url }}"
                        {% if link.current %}
                          aria-current="page"
                        {% endif %}
                      >
                        {{- link.title | escape -}}
                      </a>
                    {% endif %}
                  </li>
                {% endfor %}
              </ul>
            </nav>

            {%- if shop.customer_accounts_enabled or show_countries or show_languages -%}
              <div class="drawer__footer site-header__drawer-footer">
                {%- if shop.customer_accounts_enabled -%}
                  <shopify-account
                    class="site-header__drawer-account"
                    menu="{{ block.settings.customer_account_menu }}"
                    data-testid="header-drawer-account"
                  >
                    <span slot="signed-out-avatar" class="site-header__drawer-account-label">
                      <span aria-hidden="true">{{ 'icon-account.svg' | inline_asset_content }}</span>
                      {{- 'blocks.header.sign_in' | t -}}
                    </span>
                  </shopify-account>
                {%- endif -%}

                {%- if show_countries or show_languages -%}
                  {%- liquid
                    assign locale_code = ''
                    if show_countries
                      assign locale_code = localization.country.currency.iso_code
                    endif
                    if show_countries and show_languages
                      assign locale_code = locale_code | append: ' / '
                    endif
                    if show_languages
                      assign language_code = localization.language.iso_code | upcase
                      assign locale_code = locale_code | append: language_code
                    endif
                    assign locale_title = 'blocks.footer.localization_title' | t
                  -%}
                  {%- form 'localization', id: 'HeaderDrawerLocalizationForm' -%}
                    <details data-testid="header-drawer-localization">
                      <summary
                        class="site-header__drawer-row site-header__drawer-locale"
                        aria-controls="HeaderDrawerLocalization"
                      >
                        <span class="visually-hidden">{{ 'blocks.footer.localization_label' | t }}</span>
                        {{
                          localization.country
                          | image_url: width: 40
                          | image_tag:
                            class: 'site-header__drawer-flag',
                            width: 20,
                            height: 20,
                            alt: '',
                            loading: 'lazy'
                        }}
                        <span>{{ locale_code }}</span>
                        <span class="visually-hidden">
                          , {{ localization.country.name | escape }}, {{ localization.language.endonym_name | escape -}}
                        </span>
                        {% render 'header-icon', name: 'chevron' %}
                      </summary>
                      <div
                        class="site-header__drawer-level"
                        id="HeaderDrawerLocalization"
                        role="group"
                        aria-labelledby="HeaderDrawerLocalizationTitle"
                        data-drawer-level="2"
                        data-testid="header-drawer-level"
                      >
                        {%- render 'header-drawer-head', title: locale_title, id: 'HeaderDrawerLocalizationTitle' -%}
                        {%- if show_countries -%}
                          <p class="site-header__drawer-group-title" id="HeaderDrawerCountryLabel">
                            {{- 'blocks.footer.country_label' | t -}}
                          </p>
                          <ul class="site-header__drawer-options" aria-labelledby="HeaderDrawerCountryLabel">
                            {%- for country in localization.available_countries -%}
                              <li>
                                <button
                                  class="site-header__drawer-option"
                                  type="submit"
                                  name="country_code"
                                  value="{{ country.iso_code }}"
                                  data-testid="header-drawer-country-option"
                                  {% if country.iso_code == localization.country.iso_code %}
                                    aria-current="true"
                                  {% endif %}
                                >
                                  <span>{{ country.name | escape }}</span>
                                  <span class="site-header__drawer-currency">
                                    {{- country.currency.iso_code }}
                                    {{ country.currency.symbol -}}
                                  </span>
                                </button>
                              </li>
                            {%- endfor -%}
                          </ul>
                        {%- endif -%}
                        {%- if show_languages -%}
                          <p class="site-header__drawer-group-title" id="HeaderDrawerLanguageLabel">
                            {{- 'blocks.footer.language_label' | t -}}
                          </p>
                          <ul class="site-header__drawer-options" aria-labelledby="HeaderDrawerLanguageLabel">
                            {%- for language in localization.available_languages -%}
                              <li>
                                <button
                                  class="site-header__drawer-option"
                                  type="submit"
                                  name="language_code"
                                  value="{{ language.iso_code }}"
                                  lang="{{ language.iso_code }}"
                                  dir="auto"
                                  data-testid="header-drawer-language-option"
                                  {% if language.iso_code == localization.language.iso_code %}
                                    aria-current="true"
                                  {% endif %}
                                >
                                  {{- language.endonym_name | escape -}}
                                </button>
                              </li>
                            {%- endfor -%}
                          </ul>
                        {%- endif -%}
                      </div>
                    </details>
                  {%- endform -%}
                {%- endif -%}
              </div>
            {%- endif -%}
          </dialog>
        </modal-dialog>
      </details>
    {% endif %}

    <a
      class="site-header__logo"
      href="{{ routes.root_url }}"
      data-testid="header-logo"
      {% if logo %}
        aria-label="{{ shop.name | escape }}"
        style="--logo-width: {{ block.settings.logo_width }}px;"
      {% endif %}
    >
      {%- if logo -%}
        {% assign logo_render_width = block.settings.logo_width | times: 2 %}
        {% render 'image', image: logo, class: 'site-header__logo-image', width: logo_render_width %}
      {%- else -%}
        <span class="site-header__logo-text">{{ shop.name | escape }}</span>
      {%- endif -%}
    </a>

    {% if has_menu %}
      <nav class="site-header__nav" aria-label="{{ 'blocks.header.menu_label' | t }}" data-testid="header-menu">
        <ul class="site-header__menu">
          {% for link in menu.links %}
            {%- liquid
              # Kiểu panel theo dữ liệu menu, không setting từng mục (TE-22 AC2, navigation.md §3):
              # có con có cấp 3 → columns (A); mọi con là collection, không cấp 3 → tiles (B); còn lại dropdown (C)
              assign mega = ''
              if link.links.size > 0
                assign mega = 'tiles'
                for child in link.links
                  if child.links.size > 0
                    assign mega = 'columns'
                    break
                  endif
                  if child.type != 'collection_link'
                    assign mega = ''
                  endif
                endfor
              endif
            -%}
            <li
              class="site-header__item{% if mega != blank %} site-header__item--mega{% endif %}"
              data-testid="header-menu-item"
            >
              {% if link.links.size > 0 %}
                <details
                  {% if mega != blank %}
                    data-mega="{{ mega }}"
                  {% endif %}
                >
                  <summary
                    class="site-header__link"
                    data-testid="header-menu-toggle"
                    aria-controls="HeaderSubmenu-{{ forloop.index }}"
                    {% if mega != blank %}
                      data-layer="mega"
                    {% endif %}
                  >
                    {{ link.title | escape }}
                    {% render 'header-icon', name: 'chevron' %}
                    {%- if mega != blank -%}
                      <span class="site-header__scrim" data-testid="header-scrim" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                    {%- endif -%}
                  </summary>
                  {%- if mega == blank -%}
                    <ul
                      class="site-header__submenu"
                      id="HeaderSubmenu-{{ forloop.index }}"
                      data-testid="header-submenu"
                    >
                      {% for child in link.links %}
                        <li>
                          <a
                            class="site-header__link"
                            href="{{ child.url }}"
                            {% if child.current %}
                              aria-current="page"
                            {% endif %}
                          >
                            {{- child.title | escape -}}
                          </a>
                        </li>
                      {% endfor %}
                    </ul>
                  {%- else -%}
                    {%- liquid
                      # "View all …" theo loại link cha, không có "View all" trần (TE-22 AC3)
                      case link.type
                        when 'catalog_link'
                          assign view_all = 'blocks.header.view_all_products' | t
                        when 'collections_link'
                          assign view_all = 'blocks.header.view_all_collections' | t
                        else
                          assign link_title = link.title | escape
                          assign view_all = 'blocks.header.view_all' | t: title: link_title
                      endcase
                      assign menu_index = forloop.index
                    -%}
                    <div class="site-header__mega" data-testid="header-mega-panel">
                      <div
                        class="site-header__submenu site-header__mega-inner site-header__mega-inner--{{ mega }}"
                        id="HeaderSubmenu-{{ menu_index }}"
                        data-testid="header-submenu"
                      >
                        {%- if mega == 'columns' -%}
                          {%- comment -%} Cột 1: "View all …", con không có cấp 3, rồi nhóm đầu tiên; mỗi nhóm sau là 1 cột {%- endcomment -%}
                          <div class="site-header__mega-column" data-testid="header-mega-column">
                            <a class="site-header__mega-view-all" href="{{ link.url }}">
                              {{- view_all -}}
                              {%- render 'slideshow-icon', name: 'arrow' -%}
                            </a>
                            {%- assign loose_count = 0 -%}
                            {%- for child in link.links -%}
                              {%- if child.links.size == 0 -%}
                                {%- assign loose_count = loose_count | plus: 1 -%}
                              {%- endif -%}
                            {%- endfor -%}
                            {%- if loose_count > 0 -%}
                              <ul class="site-header__mega-list">
                                {%- for child in link.links -%}
                                  {%- if child.links.size == 0 -%}
                                    <li>
                                      <a
                                        class="site-header__mega-link"
                                        href="{{ child.url }}"
                                        {% if child.current %}
                                          aria-current="page"
                                        {% endif %}
                                      >
                                        {{- child.title | escape -}}
                                      </a>
                                    </li>
                                  {%- endif -%}
                                {%- endfor -%}
                              </ul>
                            {%- endif -%}
                            {%- for child in link.links -%}
                              {%- if child.links.size > 0 -%}
                                {%- assign group_id = 'HeaderMega-' | append: menu_index | append: '-' | append: forloop.index -%}
                                {%- render 'header-mega-group', link: child, id: group_id -%}
                                {%- break -%}
                              {%- endif -%}
                            {%- endfor -%}
                          </div>
                          {%- assign first_group_seen = false -%}
                          {%- for child in link.links -%}
                            {%- if child.links.size > 0 -%}
                              {%- if first_group_seen -%}
                                {%- assign group_id = 'HeaderMega-' | append: menu_index | append: '-' | append: forloop.index -%}
                                <div class="site-header__mega-column" data-testid="header-mega-column">
                                  {%- render 'header-mega-group', link: child, id: group_id -%}
                                </div>
                              {%- endif -%}
                              {%- assign first_group_seen = true -%}
                            {%- endif -%}
                          {%- endfor -%}
                        {%- else -%}
                          {%- comment -%} B: tiêu đề panel + "View all …" + ô collection; ảnh ô, setting bật/tắt ảnh ở TE-22-R2-FE3 {%- endcomment -%}
                          <div class="site-header__mega-head">
                            <p class="site-header__mega-heading" id="HeaderMega-{{ menu_index }}">
                              {{- link.title | escape -}}
                            </p>
                            <a class="site-header__mega-view-all" href="{{ link.url }}">
                              {{- view_all -}}
                              {%- render 'slideshow-icon', name: 'arrow' -%}
                            </a>
                          </div>
                          <ul class="site-header__mega-tiles" aria-labelledby="HeaderMega-{{ menu_index }}">
                            {%- for child in link.links -%}
                              <li>
                                <a
                                  class="site-header__mega-tile"
                                  href="{{ child.url }}"
                                  {% if child.current %}
                                    aria-current="page"
                                  {% endif %}
                                >
                                  <span class="site-header__mega-tile-title">{{- child.title | escape -}}</span>
                                  <span class="site-header__mega-tile-count">
                                    {{- 'blocks.level_card.products_count' | t: count: child.object.products_count -}}
                                  </span>
                                </a>
                              </li>
                            {%- endfor -%}
                          </ul>
                        {%- endif -%}
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  {%- endif -%}
                </details>
              {% else %}
                <a
                  class="site-header__link"
                  href="{{ link.url }}"
                  {% if link.current %}
                    aria-current="page"
                  {% endif %}
                >
                  {{- link.title | escape -}}
                </a>
              {% endif %}
            </li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ul>
      </nav>
    {% elsif request.design_mode %}
      <p class="site-header__placeholder">{{ 'blocks.header.menu_placeholder' | t }}</p>
    {% endif %}

    <div class="site-header__icons">
      <a
        class="site-header__icon"
        href="{{ routes.search_url }}"
        data-testid="header-search-link"
        aria-label="{{ 'blocks.header.search' | t }}"
        aria-haspopup="dialog"
      >
        {% render 'header-icon', name: 'search' %}
      </a>
      {% render 'predictive-search' %}

      {% if shop.customer_accounts_enabled %}
        <shopify-account
          class="site-header__icon"
          menu="{{ block.settings.customer_account_menu }}"
          data-testid="header-account"
        >
          <span slot="signed-out-avatar" class="site-header__account-icon">{{ 'icon-account.svg' | inline_asset_content }}</span>
        </shopify-account>
      {% endif %}

      {% partial 'cart-count' %}
        <a
          class="site-header__icon"
          href="{{ routes.cart_url }}"
          data-testid="header-cart-link"
          aria-label="{{ 'blocks.header.cart_count' | t: count: cart.item_count }}"
          {% if cart_drawer_active %}
            data-cart-link
            aria-haspopup="dialog"
          {% endif %}
        >
          <span aria-hidden="true">{{ 'icon-cart.svg' | inline_asset_content }}</span>
          {% if cart.item_count > 0 %}
            <span class="site-header__cart-count" data-testid="header-cart-count" aria-hidden="true">
              {{- cart.item_count -}}
            </span>
          {% endif %}
        </a>
      {% endpartial %}
    </div>
  </div>

  {%- comment -%} Host cho JS (ES1-T22): có trong markup để theme editor/Canvas render lại header thì custom element tự kết nối lại {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- if has_menu -%}
    <header-menu hidden></header-menu>
    <header-drawer hidden></header-drawer>
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- if block.settings.sticky_header -%}
    <sticky-header hidden></sticky-header>
  {%- endif -%}
</header>

{% if has_menu %}
  <script src="{{ 'header-menu.js' | asset_url }}" type="module"></script>
{% endif %}
{% if block.settings.sticky_header %}
  <script src="{{ 'header-sticky.js' | asset_url }}" type="module"></script>
{% endif %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "t:general.header",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "logo",
      "label": "t:labels.logo",
      "info": "t:info.logo"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "logo_width",
      "label": "t:labels.logo_width",
      "min": 60,
      "max": 240,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 120
    },
    {
      "type": "link_list",
      "id": "menu",
      "label": "t:labels.menu",
      "default": "main-menu"
    },
    {
      "type": "link_list",
      "id": "customer_account_menu",
      "label": "t:labels.customer_account_menu",
      "default": "customer-account-main-menu"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "sticky_header",
      "label": "t:labels.sticky_header",
      "info": "t:info.sticky_header",
      "default": true
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
